{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "story_kroos_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_kroos_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "Apples",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "Interlude",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_kroos_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "5da7a2975b52b3e7a075d25f04a15f2df89dfec75ac92eccd7379c77b8af72e1",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "One laid-back morning.\nRhodes Island Landship"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "How did I let Kroos slip away again...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Beagle",
      "text": "Don't be mad, Captain. Kroos isn't a bad girl.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "I'm not mad.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "It's just—I'm supervising her work, and every single time...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Beagle",
      "text": "She just wants to take it easy sometimes.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "Next time, maybe you should be the one keeping an eye on her. It kind of feels like she listens to you more...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Beagle",
      "text": "It's not like I do anything special either. I just watch her work.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Beagle",
      "text": "If she needs my help, l help her, and she goes back to doing it herself after a while.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "That's it?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Beagle",
      "text": "Yep, that's all I do.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "Well, what can I say? I shouldn't have expected any less from you, Beagle.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "I'm not sure why, but whenever she has half a mind to slack off, there is just no way I can keep her working...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "Sometimes she's got a stomachache. Sometimes it's Instructor Dobermann calling for her, and I always just believe her.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "And before I know it, she's gone.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "*Sigh*...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "Kroos!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "There you are.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "You aren't getting away!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "Beagle, head her off!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Beagle",
      "text": "Eh?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Beagle",
      "text": "O-Okay!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "*Pant*.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "Kroos, back to duty with me!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "(I'm just trying to take a short break!)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "Stop right there!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "(Huh? Why is Fang getting faster and faster?!)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "(I gotta come up with something.)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'Is there anything else you would like to listen to?'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scene",
      "text": "Y e s . . .",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'Okay, Lens will look it up in the library.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "(Is that Scene?)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "(Hm...)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "(Okay, let's give this a try.)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Hello~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'Oh, hello, Kroos.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Is it okay if I sit down next to you, Scene?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'Ooh—'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'Miss Scene says she doesn't mind. Go ahead!'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Thanks~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "*Pant*—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'You look pretty tired.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "I mean, there's a Kuranta chasing me~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "Kroos!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'Oh, I can hear her now. It's Fang.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "We're actually playing hide-and-seek right now.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "And after she found me, it kind of turned into a race~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Hey, Lens. Help me out, will you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'Ooh—'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scene",
      "text": "Y e s . . .",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'Miss Scene says it sounds very interesting. Lens will therefore be providing all the assistance you need, Kroos.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Thanks~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'However, I can't guarantee that Fang won't recognize you.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Well, if she catches me, I guess she'll have rightfully earned her victory~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'If you say so—'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "*Beep* *beep*!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "M.P.M No. 1",
      "text": "*Bzzt*—*Bzzt*—*Bzzt*—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "M.P.M No. 2",
      "text": "*Chime*!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "(Oh, have these buggies been here the whole time? I didn't even notice.)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "*Beep* *beep*!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "M.P.M No. 1",
      "text": "*Bzzt*—!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "M.P.M No. 2",
      "text": "*Chime* *Chime*!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "I know she hopped in here for sure.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "Just where is she?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "She's getting way too good at hiding...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scene",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "If I was Kroos...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "I'd be—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "Right around—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Beagle",
      "text": "Fang—I saw Kroos run toward the cafeteria!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "Great, I'll be right there!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Phew—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'Congratulations, Kroos. It looks like you're still hidden.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "I've seen the way Scene hides on missions before.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "It's so amazing~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'Lens uses a revolutionary new camouflage technique that combines stealth and optical refraction technologies, among others, to satisfy Miss Scene's needs.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scene",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'I'm sorry, Miss Scene. Lens forgot to put on music for you.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'And without further ado—'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Ha—This slaps.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Is it okay if I chill here for a little bit, too?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scene",
      "text": "Y e s . . .",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'Sure thing!'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "By the way, what are you doing here, Scene?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'Miss Scene is brainstorming ideas for her next piece.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'She may look like she's spacing out, but make no mistake. She's thinking.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'And while she has her thinking cap on, it is Lens's job to play music and deliver food to her.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Isn't there anyone chasing her down, trying to get her to work?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'Let's see—Not according to Lens's records.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'If anyone tried to, Lens would activate these camouflage techniques. No one would be able to find her.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Sounds so nice~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "I wish I could live like Scene does.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'I believe Miss Scene said something similar before.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'Something along the lines of, 'I wish I could live the way Cautuses do—' Something like that.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "What's so nice about us Cautuses?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "It's very exhausting~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Ever since I was young, everyone's always told me that Cautuses are meant to be more energetic, and that I shouldn't be so lazy.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "But all I ever wanna do is clear my mind and lay on the couch the whole day.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Doesn't that sound wonderful~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scene",
      "text": "Y e s . . .",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'What Miss Scene is saying is you can make your own decisions, and that is a joy in itself.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Huh?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'Let's use Lens as an analogy.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'Lens is able to take photos very quickly. Through the use of my system's auxiliary operations, Lens is capable of snapping photos of running Kuranta and storing those photos in my album without issues.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'But Miss Scene can't do that.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'Even when she's photographing people, Miss Scene takes a very long time, almost like she's sketching.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'That's why Miss Scene is a good scenery photographer. She's not good at it because she likes taking photos of landscapes.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'She wants to take photos of everything, but, most of the time, she's only able to take photos of still objects. Only they have the patience to wait until she's done without moving.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'And that's what Lens meant.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'You don't like to move, but if you put your mind to it, you can still be pretty agile.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Hm, maybe~?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'Both Lens and Click have edited operational records of your missions, Kroos.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'You usually just hang out around the destination, but once an order comes, you always head towards the new destination quickly. That makes you no different from the other Cautuses.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "That's just because I could die if I mess up~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Missions are hard~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'Without Lens, Miss Scene wouldn't even be able to move to the next location.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'Lens believes there's a difference between can't do and don't want to do.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Yes...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'There are too many things that we can't do, so let's do the things that we can do the best we can.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'This is something that Scene told Lens before.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'Of course, Miss Scene may be able to do fewer things, but the things that she can do, she does with relative ease.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'In your case, Lens supposes you probably focus on putting your energy where it matters because you know your limits?'",
