    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "But it could also be because I don't wanna work.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'Lens believes in you, Miss Kroos.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "*Bzzzzt*—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "What's wrong?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'Oh, sorry about that. The reception here isn't very good.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'The motivational r-routine that Lens s-selected to inspire you had a few e-errors.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Ugh...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'It looks like y-you w-w-w—'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Eh?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Lens?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "(The buggies stopped moving too.)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "(Did they break down?)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scene",
      "text": "—!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Scene, are you trying to say something?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scene",
      "text": "M m—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Take your time~ I'm listening~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scene",
      "text": "M m e h—",
