    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scene",
      "text": "Y a—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Beagle",
      "text": "I'm sorry, Fang, I got mixed up and went after the wrong person.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "You know, there's quite a bit of difference between Leonhardt and Kroos...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "Even if they're both Cautuses...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Beagle",
      "text": "I'm so sorry! I should've been more careful!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "It's fine. Let's look for her again. If we don't find her, we'll have to ask Meteor or Gitano for help.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "Kroos isn't going to get away.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Beagle",
      "text": "It kind of seems like she's got your full attention today, Captain.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Beagle",
      "text": "You usually turn a blind eye, but you seem really mad this time.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "I'm not mad.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "You know what Kroos said when she ran away?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Beagle",
      "text": "What?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "She said today's the anniversary of me becoming our leader, so she was going to pick out a present for me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Beagle",
      "text": "Isn't that a good thing?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "She never came back, in the end. I didn't even realize until you returned to the dorm.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Beagle",
      "text": "Is today really the anniversary?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "It is...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Beagle",
      "text": "Then that's really mean of her.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Beagle",
      "text": "I'll give her a good scolding myself.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "Good.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Beagle",
      "text": "Oh, right. Captain, happy anniversary!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "Oh, yeah. Thanks.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Beagle",
      "text": "Eh?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Beagle",
      "text": "Was that Kroos just now?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Beagle",
      "text": "I hope I'm not seeing things again...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "No, that's Kroos alright.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "Looks like she's in a hurry.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "Come. Let's go take a look.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Beagle",
      "text": "Okay.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mayer's Room, a.k.a. 'Lutra Workshop'"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "This should be it~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "(Isn't this an automatic door? Why isn't it opening?)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Mayer, are you home~?",
