    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "*cough*, actually...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Oh—Lens is dead? Shouldn't you get Closure then?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Scene thought you'd be better~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Okay, sure.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "You're in luck today. I don't have anything in that much of a rush. Otherwise, you'd have come all this way for nothing.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Keep in mind, though, if those A.I. things with the four wheels run into problems, you should try Closure first.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Okay~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Let's go, then.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "Mmm——",
