    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "Let's go back.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Beagle",
      "text": "Huh? We don't need to follow her anymore?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "If she's actually busy, then let's not get in the way.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "We'll clean up Kroos's mess for her and get something to eat.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Beagle",
      "text": "Right!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Here we are~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Hey, slow down. I haven't had breakfast...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Scene~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scene",
      "text": "Y e s . . .",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Lens?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'Why, hello, Kroos.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'Oh, you're here too, Mayer. Welcome!'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "She looks alright to me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Uh... hm?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'Lens actually rebooted not long after you left.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'Lens sometimes runs into problems with certain functions. It isn't uncommon for Lens to reboot.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Then...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'Oh, you mean what Miss Scene was trying to say? She was trying to tell you that it's okay.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'She takes a liiiittle while to get her words out, so she might've given you the wrong impression.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Aha, guess I misunderstood~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scene",
      "text": "Y e s . . .",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Well, guess I came all the way here for nothing.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'Sorry about that, Miss Mayer. Lens is doing very well.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Well, let me take a look...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Doesn't seem like there's anything wrong on the outside.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "You said you crashed just now, right?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'That's right.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Then that should be a problem with the system.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "You said it yourself. You reboot often, right?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "Y e s.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Closure didn't try to fix that for you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'Closure has already ordered replacement parts for Lens. It won't be long before Lens receives an upgrade.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Oh? Ohh—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "So those parts were for you, huh?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "I visited that dungeon of hers yesterday. She was working for the better part of the day.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "She said it was some kind of 'advanced component used in extreme circumstances to be installed on a high-end mobile photography platform.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "So she meant you, huh?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Well, this is perfect. Let's go pay Closure a visit now. We'll take care of this problem of yours.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "That way, you won't find yourself freezing up or having to install OS updates while you're out on a mission.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'Thank you very much, Mayer.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'But Lens is afraid it takes Miss Scene a while to get around too. Lens will walk with Miss Scene, so we likely won't be able to come with you straight to Closure's.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "I'll walk her there~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Is that okay, Scene~?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scene",
      "text": "Y e s—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'If that's what Miss Scene says...'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mayer",
      "text": "Okay, let's get going, then. Get it over with quickly, and I'll get to go to bed early. I have lots of work to get done tomorrow.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lens",
      "text": "'Oh, Mayer, please don't push me around like that!'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scene",
      "text": "Y e a h—!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Don't worry, Miss Mayer's just a little impatient~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Let's just take our time and walk there slowly~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "I know the way~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scene",
      "text": "Y e s . . .",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Reserve Op Team A1 Dormitory"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "I'm back~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "Oh.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Beagle",
      "text": "Welcome back.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Fang, here's some dessert I picked up for you~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Happy anniversary!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Beagle",
      "text": "Wow, muffins!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "Thanks.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "Leave them on the table. We'll share them tomorrow.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Okay~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Is anyone using the bathroom~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Beagle",
      "text": "We're going to bed. It's all yours.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kroos",
      "text": "Okay~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Beagle",
      "text": "See, Fang? Kroos actually worked all day.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Beagle",
      "text": "She even bought you a present.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "I wasn't trying to reprimand her, you know.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "If she really wants to take a break, all she has to do is tell me. I'm not going to say no.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "It's just the way she goes about makes me kinda upset sometimes.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Beagle",
      "text": "Kroos is too shy to actually say it. She's actually really thoughtful.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "I kind of think she's just toying with me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Beagle",
      "text": "Well, she's really close with you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Beagle",
      "text": "Kroos doesn't do that to most people.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "*Sigh*... I'd rather she treated me a little more normal...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "Let's go to bed. We have training first thing tomorrow morning.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "Be sure to wake Kroos up. She looked pretty tired when she got back. She just might not get up on her own.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "If she oversleeps, Instructor Dobermann...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Beagle",
      "text": "Relax, Fang, I'll drag her there if I have to.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "I hope so...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "Whatever, not gonna worry too much about it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "Bedtime now.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fang",
      "text": "Good night.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Beagle",
      "text": "Good night, Captain.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
